    https://github.com/WaresWichall/hass-anycubic_cloud

The original is the substantial majority of this work. It has been
modified and extended by Nino Bondonno from 2026 onwards; those changes
include compatibility with paho-mqtt 2.x and current Home Assistant,
verified TLS to the cloud broker, the LAN Mode connection, per-slot
filament tracking, the camera, and the test suite.

The full list of changes is in the README under "Changes from upstream".

